    "body": "Leader ruling (recorded by governance): a Parquet batch written by a remote Agent (`soroi-batch/`) holds only `seq`, `at`, `kind` and `transcript_entry`. The store fills in `run_id`, `step` and `position` when it ingests the batch at formal commit. In the SOR-19 acceptance in D8, this replaces the wording \"schema is the same as agent_progress\".",
